@*
    Shown when there is nobody left to review. Rendered directly by Index when the
    deck starts out empty, and cloned by site.js (from the <template> Index also
    renders) when the last card in the client-side stack is decided and no refill
    is coming — same markup, same copy, either way.
*@
<div class="empty-state text-center py-5">
    <h2 class="h5">You have reviewed everyone for now</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
        There is nobody left in your deck. Adding more courses, switching more of them
        on, or widening your availability will widen the pool.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Profile" asp-action="Edit">Update your profile</a>
    <a class="btn btn-link" asp-controller="Requests" asp-action="Index">See your requests</a>
</div>
